1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.008
Kanemayu akufotokoza njira yoyezera ana.

2
00:00:04.008 --> 00:00:08.017
Choyamba, chitani ukhondo m'manja, osapereka PPE ngati pakufunika.

3
00:00:08.017 --> 00:00:12.025
Dzidziwitseni nokha, fotokozani za mayeso ndikupeza chilolezo.

4
00:00:12.025 --> 00:00:19.541
Imani pang'ono kuti muyang'ane maso, ndikuyang'ana kwambiri maonekedwe a ana.

5
00:00:19.541 --> 00:00:24.300
Ndemanga pa kusiyana kulikonse mu kukula, mtundu ndi mawonekedwe,

6
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:29.060
komanso umboni uliwonse wa ptosis kapena squint.

7
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:33.820
Ngati pali kusiyana kulikonse mu kukula kwa ana omwe amadziwika kuti

8
00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:38.580
isochoria, ndiye kuti pali vuto linalake.

9
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:43.780
Yang'anani mu dimmer, ndiyeno kuyatsa kowala kuti muwone ngati kukuwonetsa kusiyana kulikonse.

10
00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:47.887
Kenako, funsani wodwalayo kuti akonze mtunda womwe akufuna ndikuwunika Mwana wa disoyo

11
00:00:47.887 --> 00:00:51.993
mayankho m'chipinda chowala kwambiri pogwiritsa ntchito kuwala kowala kwambiri kwa arc

12
00:00:51.993 --> 00:00:52.580
lupu lowala.

13
00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:56.080
Tsopano yesani ndikuwona mayankho atatu owala.

14
00:00:56.080 --> 00:01:00.580
Yambani ndi yankho lachindunji poyang'ana Mwana wa diso akuwunikiridwa.

15
00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:07.080
Kenako yang'anani yankho logwirizana poyang'ana Mwana wa diso winayo yemwe sakuwunikiridwa mwachindunji.

16
00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:14.440
Chachitatu, yang'anani vuto lachibale la papillary, lomwe nthawi zambiri limafupikitsidwa kukhala REPD, pogwiritsa ntchito

17
00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:17.260
kuyezetsa kuwala.

18
00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:21.262
Chinsinsi chochita mayesowa ndikusuntha kuwala pakati pa

19
00:01:21.262 --> 00:01:22.120
maso awiri patsogolo

20
00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:24.520
Mwana wa disoyo ali ndi nthawi yothawa.

21
00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:30.920
Koma ndiye dikirani kwa masekondi 2-3, kuti Mwana wa diso akhazikike, kuyang'anitsitsa mosamala zonse.

22
00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:32.720
kusintha kukula.

23
00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:36.541
Mwa achichepere mutha kuwona kusinthasintha kwakanthawi kochepa monga Mwana wa diso

24
00:01:36.541 --> 00:01:37.360
kukwera pamwamba ndi

25
00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:38.545
pansi musanakhazikike.

26
00:01:38.545 --> 00:01:41.310
Izi zimatchedwa mvuu mwachibadwa.

27
00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.680
Pakuyezetsa kuwala kuyesa ngati

28
00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:50.715
Mwana wa diso amatambasula modabwitsa pamene kuwala kukuwonetsedwa, RAPD ilipo.

29
00:01:50.715 --> 00:01:51.720
Mu izi

30
00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:55.621
fufuzani Mwana wa diso wakumanzere amatambasula akaunikiridwa.

31
00:01:55.621 --> 00:01:58.965
RAPD yakumanzere ilipo.

32
00:01:58.965 --> 00:02:00.080
Izi mwamphamvu

33
00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:06.440
Zimasonyeza kuti pali matenda a retina kapena minyewa ya optic kumanzere.

34
00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:08.649
Chiyeso chomaliza ndicho kuyankha kwapafupi.

35
00:02:08.649 --> 00:02:12.120
Funsani wodwalayo kuti akonze chapatali, kenako funsani

36
00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:16.600
iwo kuyang'ana mwatsatanetsatane pafupi chandamale monga mbalame pa

37
00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:17.560
Arclight. Izi zimayambitsa

38
00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:17.985
